             TCP THREE-WAY HANDSHAKE

Client                                      Server
  │                                            │
  │────────────── SYN ───────────────────────►│
  │                                            │
  │◄──────────── SYN-ACK ─────────────────────│
  │                                            │
  │────────────── ACK ───────────────────────►│
  │                                            │
  │                                            │
  │         CONNECTION ESTABLISHED             │
  │                                            │
  │══════════ Application Data ═══════════════►│




SYN     → Connection initiation
SYN-ACK → Acknowledge + participate in setup
ACK     → Final acknowledgement
